{"id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-open-closed-topologies.md","title":"Definition — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑","display":"Definition — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","aliases":["14-df-open-closed-topologies"],"display":"Definition — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑","source_ref":"IX.4, p.486 (8)–(12), DjVu249 left; elementary-topos reconstruction from V.1","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-open-closed-topologies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-open-closed-topologies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IX.4, p.486 (8)–(12), DjVu249 left; elementary-topos reconstruction from V.1"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span>、有限积及指数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:U\\hookrightarrow1\">\\(m:U\\hookrightarrow1\\)</span> 是单态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=\\chi_m:1\\to\\Omega\">\\(u=\\chi_m:1\\to\\Omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span> 是其子对象类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 是子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的特征箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\">\\(U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\)</span> 是以下新构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_X:=!_X^{-1}([m]),\\qquad \\mathsf T:=[\\top]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_X:=!_X^{-1}([m]),\\qquad \\mathsf T:=[\\top]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j_U^{\\mathrm o}:=\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\circ\\langle u\\circ!_\\Omega,1_\\Omega\\rangle,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm c}:=\\chi_{U_\\Omega\\vee_\\Omega\\mathsf T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j_U^{\\mathrm o}:=\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\circ\\langle u\\circ!_\\Omega,1_\\Omega\\rangle,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm c}:=\\chi_{U_\\Omega\\vee_\\Omega\\mathsf T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书 IX.4 印刷 p.486 式 (8)–(12) 对 locale 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\Rightarrow(-)\">\\(U\\Rightarrow(-)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\vee(-)\">\\(U\\vee(-)\\)</span> 两种核；已比对 DjVu249 左页图像。这里是它们在初等拓扑斯真值对象上的重构，不冒称原书逐字给出此推广。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_X\">\\(U_X\\)</span> 是拉回子对象，交并与特征箭头已有存在唯一性，故两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 构造不依赖单态射代表。层满子范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a> 的构造；两个箭头确为 LT 拓扑由下一项证明。这里闭子拓扑斯指与开支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对应的闭补，而非把伪补子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg U\">\\(\\neg U\\)</span> 误当成集合补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifier-meet-implication","status":"resolved","id":"c10899c45464ad7f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifier-meet-implication","status":"resolved","id":"c10899c45464ad7f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$、有限积及指数。$m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 是单态射，$u=\\chi_m:1\\to\\Omega$。$[m]$ 是其子对象类，$\\chi_A$ 是子对象 $A$ 的特征箭头；$\\Rightarrow_\\Omega$ 见 [[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]。$U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$ 是以下新构造，$X$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IX.4 印刷 p.486 式 (8)–(12) 对 locale 给出 $U\\Rightarrow(-)$ 与 $U\\vee(-)$ 两种核；已比对 DjVu249 左页图像。这里是它们在初等拓扑斯真值对象上的重构，不冒称原书逐字给出此推广。$U_X$ 是拉回子对象，交并与特征箭头已有存在唯一性，故两个 $\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 构造不依赖单态射代表。层满子范畴采用 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]] 的构造；两个箭头确为 LT 拓扑由下一项证明。这里闭子拓扑斯指与开支撑 $U$ 对应的闭补，而非把伪补子对象 $\\neg U$ 误当成集合补。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"m:U\\hookrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"u=\\chi_m:1\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"U_X:=!_X^{-1}([m]),\\qquad \\mathsf T:=[\\top]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"j_U^{\\mathrm o}:=\\Rightarrow_\\Omega\\circ\\langle u\\circ!_\\Omega,1_\\Omega\\rangle,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm c}:=\\chi_{U_\\Omega\\vee_\\Omega\\mathsf T}.","display":true},{"tex":"U\\Rightarrow(-)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\vee(-)","display":false},{"tex":"U_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg U","display":false}],"bytes":2275,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies|df-240 — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$j^{\\mathrm o}_{L,u},j^{\\mathrm c}_{L,u}$ 是 locale 框架上的核，不是[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]的拓扑斯真值箭头。$F_o,F_c$ 是对应固定点框架；$q_o,q_c,s_o,s_c,\\alpha_o,\\beta_o$ 为下式集合函数。$o_u,c_u$ 是带源靶的 locale 箭头。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies|df-240 — 子终对象决定的开拓扑与闭拓扑]]"},{"id":"7b364b0997153626","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 与闭拓扑。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，$\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U$ 为投影；$0$ 为初对象。"},{"id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$A$ 是 $X$ 的任意子对象；$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]，$\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X$ 见 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。"},{"id":"f255d6c7945bca41","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,U,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$\\wedge_\\Omega$ 是典范真值交；$k$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)$。$j_\\top$ 是以下恒真箭头。"},{"id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 与开拓扑。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\Lambda_U$ 是指数转置，$\\pi_X:X\\times U\\to X$ 为投影；$\\delta_X$ 是以下新箭头。"},{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的数据；$\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)$。切片对象为 $P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)$，切片箭头为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的 $(P,Q,h)$，其中 $h$ 是底层箭头。$\\Lambda_U$ 为指数转置，$\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y$ 为求值；下式定义 $h^U$，其中 $h:Y\\to Z$。$F,G$ 是以下分量给出的候选函子；$h:X\\to X'$ 在第一式中为 $\\mathcal S$ 的箭头。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","b51ff4f43221971d","1289398555ba3eed","c10899c45464ad7f","1044b7940aaa4f1f","389620cd4ca5e1c6"]}